  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Great Vermintide" id="fb49-cf71-d602-5614" hidden="false">
      <description>If your Army Faction is SKAVEN, If a unit in this Army is at Half-Strength or below, subtract 1 from leadership tests and gain the following benefits:


• For friendly SKAVEN INFANTRY: No mortal damage is inflicted when calculating desperate escape checks.


• For friendly SKAVEN MONSTER units: All Melee Weapons gain DEVASTATING WOUNDS.


• For friendly SKAVEN VEHICLE and MOUNTED Units: Gain the</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
