                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During your deployment phase: Pick another friendly SKAVEN CHARACTER on the battlefield with a Health characteristic that equals or exceeds the bearer&apos;s Health characteristic to be the target. For the rest of the battle:

• While the target has not been slain, friendly SKAVEN INFANTRY units have Feel No Pain (6+) while they are wholly within 13&quot; of the bearer.
• Once the target has been slain, add 2 to charge rolls for friendly SKAVEN INFANTRY units while they are wholly within 13&quot; of the bearer.</characteristic>
