            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If you declared the ‘**Scatter-Move!**’ stratagem for a friendly ESHIN INFANTRY unit wholly within 13&quot; of this unit. If you roll a 1-3 when determining the distance that unit can move, you can use a value of 4 instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shadow Strike" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="3fff-0978-ff12-3bcc">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If you use the &apos;**Burst from the Shadows**&apos; stratagem on this unit you may pick a point that is within 1&quot; of any enemy units. Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1&quot; of that point.

Designer’s Note: This ability allows the unit to set up in engagement with a new enemy unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Verminlord Deceiver" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="fdd7-6faa-238f-f98f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">12&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">7</characteristic>
