      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Thirteen-headed One" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="2e54-0aa5-9902-b9f5">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Your Command Phase. Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next command phase.

• **Master of Dire Sorcery**: Add 1 damage to weapons used by friendly MASTERCLAN PSYKERS while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• **Commander of Vermin**: Add 1 to charge rolls for friendly VERMINUS units while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• **Knower of Warp-tech**: Add 1 to hit rolls for shooting attacks made by friendly SKRYRE units while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• **Deliverer of Weeping Blades**: Add 1 to Armour Peneatration for weapons used by friendly ESHIN units while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• **Bringer of Plagues**: Increase leadership by 1 for friendly PESTILENS PSYKERS while they are wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.
• **Shaper of Fleshcraft**: Heal (D3) each friendly MOULDER unit wholly within 13&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord Skreech Verminking" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="acac-8b74-aded-9d27">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10&quot;</characteristic>
