        <profile name="Warp-Ambush" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="6409-1619-4a9a-c418">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Before you would set up this unit and the unit selected from &quot;Tunnel Skulkers&quot;: pick an enemy unit more than 6&quot; from all other enemy units to be the target and then roll a dice. On a 4+, set up both units within 3&quot; of the target and more than 6&quot; from all other enemy units. On a 6, you may put both units in engagement range of the target instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tunnel Skulkers" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="9505-eb2c-66e1-7ac1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Pick this unit and up to 1 friendly non-SKAVEN MONSTER unit if those units have not been deployed, both units are now considered to have **Deep Strike**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
