      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Greatest Invention" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="b7d3-df6a-a97b-a340">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If using Warpcog Convocation Detachment rules:
Once per Battle, use the &apos;**Doomsphere Launch**&apos; stratagem for free. Additonally &apos;Doomsphere Launch**&apos; strategem can now be used on a target within 24&quot; of this character and now wounds on 4+.
If not using Warpcog Convocation Detachment rules:
Once per Battle Round, if a friendly SKRYRE unit wholly within 20&quot; of this unit uses the &apos;**Fire Overwatch**&apos; stratagem, no command points are spent and the unit regains 1d3 lost wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Ikit Claw" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="b08c-3e20-5f60-6668">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">6&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="SV" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">4+</characteristic>
